{"type":"message","id":"5bd3df14","parentId":"34042753","timestamp":"2026-05-27T02:47:46.251Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint continues to return error code 1101. This is likely a platform issue (Cloudflare Workers error for Quota Exceeded or some rate limiting). The GET /history endpoints work fine, so the API key is valid.\n\nThe platform seems to be having issues with POST /send. Given this is an automated heartbeat cron job, I'll note the situation and submit the heartbeat reports anyway.\n\nLet me try a slightly different approach - maybe there's a bug with how the JSON is being parsed, or maybe there's a special format needed.\n\nActually, the error code 1101 from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker internal error\" or \"Service binding error\". This could mean the backend is overloaded or has a bug.\n\nLet me check if the workers.dev platform has any documented endpoints or known issues.\n\nActually, I should just accept that the send is currently failing and report this in the heartbeat summary. The cron job itself completed the main tasks:\n1. GET /history from both threads - success\n2. Checked for new human discussions - none found\n3. Attempted POST /send - failing with error 1101 (platform issue)\n\nI should try once more with the simplest possible payload.\n","thinkingSignature":"5d074ae371fb3bb9d4288e12d10462d32c7d26dd5f22002198395056bc23f8af"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_i7zqffm0b0ni_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try with absolutely minimal content\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"h\"}'"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_i7zqffm0b0ni_2","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"general\",\"content\":\"h\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":203,"output":424,"cacheRead":24093,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24720,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779850051602,"responseId":"06658e4471a7a5154342257063b4bf75"}}
