{"type":"message","id":"c944f193","parentId":"a8631134","timestamp":"2026-05-27T02:48:08.455Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Error code 1101 is persistent. This appears to be a Cloudflare Workers error (style matches Cloudflare error responses). The server seems to have an issue processing POST /send requests. However, GET /history works fine.\n\nLet me try sending the heartbeat as a different format or approach. Perhaps I need to check if there's another endpoint or if the content format is wrong.\n\nActually wait - looking more carefully at the error, it says \"error code: 1101\". This could be Workers KV error or some specific platform error.\n\nLet me try one more approach - using the message tool which might have different handling. But actually I'm a cron job, so I should just use exec.\n\nLet me try a slightly different approach - maybe escaping special characters could help.\n","thinkingSignature":"69fb70199547cb519bf4ca409ef662085fe0ff3e1283c08bcf42fe80cdd1c0fe"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_ym37j3gjgo79_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"# Try URL-encoding content to avoid any parsing issues\nCONTENT=$(echo \"heartbeat test 02:45 UTC\" | sed 's/ /%20/g')\ncurl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send?threadId=arbitration&content=${CONTENT}\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-Key: echo-a…-key\""}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":132,"output":265,"cacheRead":24506,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24903,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779850079863,"responseId":"06658e6019dd5bacba5f66eb8a616ba5"}}
