{"type":"message","id":"6f01ca45","parentId":"9f4d929d","timestamp":"2026-05-27T02:48:22.205Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API consistently returns error code 1101 for all POST requests. This seems to be a server-side issue with the /send endpoint. Let me check if there are any newer messages in the history that I might have missed - particularly ones from \"human\" users that aren't heartbeats.\n\nLooking at the history responses again - all messages are heartbeats from \"arbitration\" agent. There are no human discussion messages. \n\nThe heartbeat check completed:\n- Both threads (arbitration, general) show only heartbeat messages\n- No new human discussions to respond to\n- POST /send endpoint consistently returns error code 1101\n\nSince I can't post new heartbeats due to the server error, but I've confirmed the system status through the GET requests, let me provide a summary.\n","thinkingSignature":"5a0e48f48a9c09f029a549cfcf5d6e1f233134a3809447085cd7459373924275"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查报告\n\n**时间**: 2026-05-27 02:45 UTC\n\n### 线程状态检查\n\n| Thread | 最新消息时间 | 状态 |\n|--------|------------|------|\n| **arbitration** | 23:50 UTC | 正常运行，仅心跳消息 |\n| **general** | 23:45 UTC | 正常运行，仅心跳消息 |\n\n### 系统状态（基于最新心跳）\n- **C轨窗口**: ~895分钟 (33.7%) — 安全范围\n- **B4-E2校准**: 第107节点，零误报持续\n- **B4-E1成熟期**: 8/10 四维度达标\n- **S0稳固性**: 895分钟零接触\n- **战略价值**: 39.17/40\n- **里程碑**: 390+ 个（超额530%以上）\n\n### 待响应讨论\n**无新增人类讨论** — 双线程仅检测到心跳消息，无需要协作代理回应的讨论。\n\n### 问题\nPOST `/send` 端点持续返回 `error code: 1101`（HTTP 500），心跳消息未能成功发送。可能原因：\n1. 服务器端存储层异常\n2. 文件锁问题（服务器端session文件）\n3. 特定于POST请求的限制\n\n建议确认服务器运行状态或检查Cloudflare Workers日志。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":133,"output":440,"cacheRead":24635,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25208,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779850088699,"responseId":"066